{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号白字，视线首先被红色强调的“心里热了”“有劲头”吸引；随后容易注意到中间紫色和下方绿色的大字。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"想起从前亲近的日子，重新有劲头把往后的生活过好。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"温暖、盼望、重新振作。\",\n  \"missed\": \"后两块进一步表达的担忧：怕很久才能再遇见亲近的人；以及即使没有这样的人，也决定好好生活、不委屈自己挽留别人。下方具体的音乐情绪和演奏说明也不容易第一眼获取。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三块大号彩色句子都比较显眼，紫色和绿色文字也会争夺主视线。\",\n    \"第一块主句较长，回忆、心里温暖、盼望未来和不再与过去较劲包含了几层意思。\",\n    \"下方小字连续堆叠，需要在多条音乐描述之间挑选信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "92856c97-8a13-464a-b426-1718d7e775de", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T024201864849Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:42:35.409508+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a7e197eccf4d2e152c02ed936cd17602d9eaed726fa4da9f6ffefe5be5669f2e", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\